    <output type="test">src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx</output>
    <output type="notes">projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/notes/task-030-inventory.md</output>
    <output type="docs">projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md (🔲 → ✅ for SRFR-030)</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">ControlManifest.Input.xml declares bound properties `regardingRecordNumberField` (default `sprk_regardingrecordnumber`) and `regardingRecordNameField` (default `sprk_regardingrecordname`); input property `title` defaults to "Related Record".</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Platform-library declarations for React 16 and Fluent 9 preserved unchanged (grep for `platform-library` in manifest); bundle-size delta consistent with virtual pattern (no bundled framework).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rendered DOM has exactly 2 rows in the control shell; Row 1 contains title text + right-aligned button; Row 2 contains a `role="link"` element for record-number and a text node for record-name.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Toolbar icon click opens a menu populated with 11 entries from `sprk_recordtype_ref` (verified via test-double catalog).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Selecting an entity invokes `Xrm.Utility.lookupObjects` with `entityTypes: [selectedEntity]`, `allowMultiSelect: false`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`PolymorphicPicker` imported from `@spaarke/ui-components` (grep confirms path); onSelect callback invokes `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields()` with `sourceRecordNumberField` derived from catalog row.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No console errors on `init()` in test harness.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/code-review` and `/adr-check` pass at Step 9.5 (or all findings addressed / escalated per CLAUDE.md §6.5).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
</task>
